WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:05.400
Module 01 · Course 1 · Clarify · For entrepreneurs
Strategic Foundations

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.800
Make the connected decisions everything you build will depend on: why it should exist, for whom and what comes first.

3
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:29.504
This module helps you make the connected decisions everything else rests on: why your idea should exist, who it is for, what you value, which form it takes, where you add unique value and what comes first.

4
00:00:29.904 --> 00:00:30.504
Why it matters now

5
00:00:30.504 --> 00:00:36.178
1. Every later choice, from hiring to branding, depends on these decisions.

6
00:00:36.178 --> 00:00:41.852
2. Deciding early is cheaper than changing direction after you have launched.

7
00:00:41.852 --> 00:00:49.267
3. Clear priorities help you say no to good ideas that do not fit.

8
00:00:49.667 --> 00:00:58.467
What you will work through: 1.1 Purpose, vision and mission · 1.2 Context and landscape analysis · 1.3 Stakeholder mapping · 1.4 Values in practice · 1.5 Organisational form and identity · 1.6 Positioning and comparative advantage · 1.7 Strategic objectives: external and internal · 1.8 Recap: Strategic Foundations

9
00:00:58.867 --> 00:00:59.467
By the end you will have

10
00:00:59.467 --> 00:01:05.511
1. A purpose, vision and mission you can explain in one sentence each.

11
00:01:05.511 --> 00:01:11.185
2. Values described as behaviour, and a first choice of legal form.

12
00:01:11.185 --> 00:01:17.859
3. A clear position and a few strategic objectives, external and internal.

13
00:01:18.259 --> 00:01:18.859
How to work through it

14
00:01:18.859 --> 00:01:24.904
1. Take it lesson by lesson over several sessions; these decisions deserve time.

15
00:01:24.904 --> 00:01:31.319
2. Test your mission and positioning with a few people you hope to serve.

16
00:01:31.319 --> 00:01:37.993
3. Compare each step with our example bakery’s purpose, mission and objectives.

17
00:01:38.593 --> 00:01:40.593
You create: Your Strategic Foundation: purpose, vision, mission, values, form, positioning and objectives.

18
00:01:40.593 --> 00:01:45.393
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

19
00:01:46.893 --> 00:01:49.993
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
